{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"fc0c 1528 PS1: LLM-Review+1 PASS but Verified-1 CI FAIL. Root cause (MINE): oracle tests invoke 'ruff check' subprocess which writes .ruff_cache into REPO_ROOT; conftest leak-guard fails teardown. Fixed: added --no-cache to all 3 ruff subprocess calls; ruff format re-wrapped 2 long lines. Verified no cache leak + oracle 12/12 green. Amended PS2, rebased onto origin/main 45ad7d3ece, re-pushed. ARG still 21, lint clean. Awaiting PS2 CI."},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1786149580094950001,"uuid":"b701ca2d-ca94-4c8e-907d-1c49bfd8903f"}